repair = "Before the first registration, seed module prefix 1,0,9 with program-owner NUL || program = 1 || principal and program-account-profile NUL || program = 2 || principal, matching precompiles/layerxprograms/view_accounts_test.go and the persisted ABI2 profile-2 opt-in; register the rewards account with profile 1 through Host.Execute, then execute CREATE and Fund under both guests."

