epoch_fixture = "Use the real reserve_epoch and terminalize producers with a positive scored WorkerAggregate, structural EpochAggregation and exact allocation to retain epoch 7 with its dictionary and refund cursor. Decode the encoded joint admission table and assert current_epoch 7; bind the envelope to 7 and its roster and use origin_height + 7*128 + 127 for the height, with an unexpired envelope. Keep exact ledger, opaque-region, revision, replay, wrong-epoch and wrong-roster assertions."
storage_reads = "The 1114-byte terminal storage_read_bytes recorded at call.c:1456 is 1084 shared-state value bytes + 14 bytes of the paxai/state/v1 key (abi/storage_ops.rs storage_read_selected uses storage::metered_bytes) + 16 bytes of the rewards-account u128 balance observation (host/balance.rs balance_read). The extra 30 bytes are that key and balance read; ledger settlement adds no separate runtime storage-read charge. Assert their exact sum. Storage writes likewise charge the 14-byte key plus the next-state bytes."
